っているんですね","ts":"1625215859.348100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LwwEe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2bde908-2cb8-4dff-adb1-d37471f9663b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"デジタル大辞泉、曰く付きなんです？","ts":"1625215856.348000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bXvj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1306dec6-cf9c-4af6-b107-84c2b09022ce","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"~またデジタル大辞泉かー~ 冤罪でした","ts":"1625215742.347200","edited":{"user":"U023KQQKC6T","ts":"1625216745.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cLh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bd0e89a-9b02-4ccd-bf12-15b6907b11e1","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://dictionary.goo.ne.jp/word/%E8%A7%A6%E6%89%8B%E3%82%92%E4%BC%B8%E3%81%B0%E3%81%99/\u003e","ts":"1625215650.346800","attachments":[{"fallback":"goo辞書: 触手を伸ばす（しょくしゅをのばす）の意味 - goo国語辞書","id":1,"title":"触手を伸ばす（しょくしゅをのばす）の意味 - goo国語辞書","title_link":"https://dictionary.goo.ne.jp/word/%E8%A7%A6%E6%89%8B%E3%82%92%E4%BC%B8%E3%81%B0%E3%81%99/","text":"触手を伸ばす（しょくしゅをのばす）とは。意味や解説、類語。欲しいものを得ようとして働きかける。「輸出業に―・す」 - goo国語辞書は30万4千件語以上を収録。政治・経済・医学・ITなど、最新用語の追加も定期的に行っています。","image_url":"https://u.xgoo.jp/img/sns/dictionary.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"goo辞書","service_icon":"http://u.xgoo.jp/img/sns/dictionary.png","from_url":"https://dictionary.goo.ne.jp/word/%E8%A7%A6%E6%89%8B%E3%82%92%E4%BC%B8%E3%81%B0%E3%81%99/","original_url":"https://dictionary.goo.ne.jp/word/%E8%A7%A6%E6%89%8B%E3%82%92%E4%BC%B8%E3%81%B0%E3%81%99/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N/P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ec5bd8c-9bf3-4a67-9ba0-1fa32f2ef603","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"食指は伸びないという話もあります。\n\u003chttps://news.yahoo.co.jp/byline/fuwaraizo/20131117-00029421/\u003e","ts":"1625215376.346500","attachments":[{"fallback":"Yahoo!ニュース 個人: 伸びるのは「食指」か「触手」か・言い間違いされる言葉たち（不破雷蔵） - Yahoo!ニュース","id":1,"title":"伸びるのは「食指」か「触手」か・言い間違いされる言葉たち（不破雷蔵） - Yahoo!ニュース","title_link":"https://news.yahoo.co.jp/byline/fuwaraizo/20131117-00029421/","text":"言い間違い、聞き間違いなどを経て、いつの間にか誤用している言い回し。指摘されて初めて気が付くものも多い。それら「言い間違いされる言葉」の代表的なものを見ていくことにする。","image_url":"https://newsbyl-pctr.c.yimg.jp/r/iwiz-yn/rpr/fuwaraizo/00029421/top_image","blocks":null,"service_name":"Yahoo!ニュース 個人","service_icon":"https://s.yimg.jp/images/ipn/wcb/news129.png","from_url":"https://news.yahoo.co.jp/byline/fuwaraizo/20131117-00029421/","original_url":"https://news.yahoo.co.jp/byline/fuwaraizo/20131117-00029421/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZM9Nz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42a49ef2-1ae6-4fa0-abb1-e99a46af1078","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"まぁEmacserにはctrlを押す専用の触手がありますからね (?)","ts":"1625215329.346300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LPNxV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce650cfe-1289-42b8-901e-4d81d50d6b2b","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"（食指では、いや lisp alian かも、というアレです :sunglasses: ）","ts":"1625215285.346000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bF/lE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8cbb6714-f2af-4d65-b65f-9b9f020d3c88","type":"message","user":"U023KQQKC6T","text":"\u003chttp://www.lisperati.com/lisplogo_alien_256.png\u003e","ts":"1625215239.345100","attachments":[{"fallback":"256x150px image","id":1,"image_url":"http://www.lisperati.com/lisplogo_alien_256.png","blocks":null,"from_url":"http://www.lisperati.com/lisplogo_alien_256.png","original_url":"http://www.lisperati.com/lisplogo_alien_256.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fuita","count":2,"users":["U012MBD7MFZ","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dNy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3a363a3-39c9-42e6-8b3a-00a1aaa41432","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"多分だから\n\u0026gt; cloneするときはMagitに「いつものディレクトリ」を指定する機能があるので、それを ~/dev/forks に指定している。\nここなんでしょうね。ghqとmagitで機能が被ってて、magitでghqでやりたいことをもう出来てるのであまり触手が伸びない。","ts":"1625215045.344600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qYhK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D4632B73-4DB2-4EEB-A1C8-77ADABD73734","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"なるほど。僕はリポジトリの配置ルールをghqに任せてしまっているので、cloneはghqでぜんぶやっていますね。おそらくそれをしないかぎりghqを使う必要ないと思います。","ts":"1625214087.344300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jLA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bf38943-70a4-4b60-9d34-c84a7f7d319b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"cloneするときはMagitに「いつものディレクトリ」を指定する機能があるので、それを `~/dev/forks` に指定している。\ncloneしたディレクトリは全部 `~/dev/forks` に落ちる。\n言い換えればcloneはMagit経由でしかしない。\n\u003chttps://github.com/magit/magit/blob/1173134ad5de3224903f6267a4f90a0de551bbd9/lisp/magit-clone.el#L53-L62\u003e","ts":"1625210370.342100","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/magit/magit/blob/1173134ad5de3224903f6267a4f90a0de551bbd9/lisp/magit-clone.el | magit-clone.el\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/magit/magit/blob/1173134ad5de3224903f6267a4f90a0de551bbd9/lisp/magit-clone.el | magit-clone.el\u003e","text":"```\n(defcustom magit-clone-default-directory nil\n  \"Default directory to use when `magit-clone' reads destination.\nIf nil (the default), then use the value of `default-directory'.\nIf a directory, then use that.  If a function, then call that\nwith the remote url as only argument and use the returned value.\"\n  :package-version '(magit . \"2.90.0\")\n  :group 'magit-commands\n  :type '(choice (const     :tag \"value of default-directory\")\n                 (directory :tag \"constant directory\")\n                 (function  :tag \"function's value\")))\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/magit/magit|magit/magit\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P4ne8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b394ee5-9b3f-45b6-840b-bf46f56da946","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"org-generate: \u003chttps://github.com/conao3/org-generate.el\u003e","ts":"1625210084.341600","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"conao3/org-generate.el","id":1,"title":"conao3/org-generate.el","text":"Generate template files/folders from one org document","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"33","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Emacs Lisp","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YGS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e985d505-7659-44b0-8bdb-7b7ceb7e0877","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"作業フロー\n- org-generateでディレクトリと定型文を生成 (ライセンスとか)\n  - ~/dev/reposにディレクトリ生成\n  - ~/dev/reposをdiredで開く\n- ディレクトリをdiredで辿る\n- `M-! git init`\n- Magitでadd, commit\n- Emacsでコード書く\n- `M-! hub create` (GitHubにレポジトリ作らず没にすることがあるので。特にプロジェクト名は変わりやすいので後で `hub create` )\n- Magitでpush","ts":"1625210039.341400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UsxS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"befa2ff5-6c31-41ce-9fe4-38a9349b49de","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/isanasan_/status/1408573347789565953\u003e\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/conao_3/status/1408616065614024711\u003e\nこれのアンサーソング\n\u003chttps://zenn.dev/isana/articles/20210628fzfghq\u003e\n私はそこらへんEmacsでよしなにやってるのでghqの支援は受けてないなと。","ts":"1625209409.340300","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/isanasan_|@isanasan_\u003e: fzfとghqがないとプログラミング出来ないというよりプログラミングを始められない。プログラミングに対する心理的、作業的ハードルを下げてくれる","id":1,"author_name":"いさな","author_subname":"@isanasan_","author_link":"https://twitter.com/isanasan_/status/1408573347789565953","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1252940964915630082/zpCwou_v_normal.jpg","text":"fzfとghqがないとプログラミング出来ないというよりプログラミングを始められない。プログラミングに対する心理的、作業的ハードルを下げてくれる","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1624665030,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/isanasan_/status/1408573347789565953","original_url":"https://twitter.com/isanasan_/status/1408573347789565953"},{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/conao_3|@conao_3\u003e: ghq何が便利なのか分からない勢","id":2,"author_name":"Conao3","author_subname":"@conao_3","author_link":"https://twitter.com/conao_3/status/1408616065614024711","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2316411565/image_normal.jpg","text":"ghq何が便利なのか分からない勢","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1624675215,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/conao_3/status/1408616065614024711","original_url":"https://twitter.com/conao_3/status/1408616065614024711"},{"fallback":"Zenn: fzfとghqを組み合わせてプログラミングの心理的・作業的負荷を軽減する","id":3,"title":"fzfとghqを組み合わせてプログラミングの心理的・作業的負荷を軽減する","title_link":"https://zenn.dev/isana/articles/20210628fzfghq","image_url":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dlhzyuewr/image/upload/s--9bAxN6gg--/co_rgb:222%2Cg_south_west%2Cl_text:notosansjp-medium.otf_37_bold:Isana%2Cx_203%2Cy_98/c_fit%2Cco_rgb:222%2Cg_north_west%2Cl_text:notosansjp-medium.otf_70_bold:fzf%25E3%2581%25A8ghq%25E3%2582%2592%25E7%25B5%2584%25E3%2581%25BF%25E5%2590%2588%25E3%2582%258F%25E3%2581%259B%25E3%2581%25A6%25E3%2583%2597%25E3%2583%25AD%25E3%2582%25B0%25E3%2583%25A9%25E3%2583%259F%25E3%2583%25B3%25E3%2582%25B0%25E3%2581%25AE%25E5%25BF%2583%25E7%2590%2586%25E7%259A%2584%25E3%2583%25BB%25E4%25BD%259C%25E6